{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wandering Within</strong> is a survival game where you have to cross a hostile desert to unravel the mysteries of a legendary chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find water, food and make a firecamp, as the nights will be freezing. Build a variety of tools and find your way through an environment that will do anything to lose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a world rich in legends, strange places and characters who will guide you on your quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bar of hunger, thirst and warmth to be maintained at all times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is final, no room for error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tool-making system to increase your chances of survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NAVIGATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your sense of direction will be severely tested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the instructions of other desert dwellers to find the next point of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Familiarise yourself with a procedurally generated environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep moving to ensure your survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEGEND</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the myths of the desert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decipher the mysteries surrounding a sealed chest containing immeasurable powers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558550?t=1742398561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558550?t=1742398561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558550/f1a9ad5193fafdc53da1ba771e26c3e4955b139c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742398561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558550/f1a9ad5193fafdc53da1ba771e26c3e4955b139c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742398561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wandering Within</strong> is a survival game where you have to cross a hostile desert to unravel the mysteries of a legendary chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find water, food and make a firecamp, as the nights will be freezing. Build a variety of tools and find your way through an environment that will do anything to lose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a world rich in legends, strange places and characters who will guide you on your quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bar of hunger, thirst and warmth to be maintained at all times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is final, no room for error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tool-making system to increase your chances of survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NAVIGATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your sense of direction will be severely tested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the instructions of other desert dwellers to find the next point of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Familiarise yourself with a procedurally generated environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep moving to ensure your survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEGEND</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the myths of the desert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decipher the mysteries surrounding a sealed chest containing immeasurable powers</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lonely Crows"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558550/header.jpg?t=1742398561","is_f